    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Trianguluv</strong> is a fast-paced, neon-drenched arcade experience where precision meets pulse-pounding rhythm. Navigate your triangle through a mesmerizing maze of shifting shapes, dodge deadly patterns, and chase the perfect run in a game that\u2019s easy to pick up\u2014but hard to put down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca0 <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Tight, responsive controls</strong> \u2013 perfect for quick reflexes and precise movements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf08 <strong>Minimalist visuals</strong> \u2013 clean, vibrant, and hypnotic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Electro-infused soundtrack</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Instant restarts</strong> \u2013 fail fast, try again faster</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're a speedrunner or just vibing with the music, <i>Trianguluv</i> offers a pure, stylish adrenaline rush.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Trianguluv</strong> is a fast-paced, neon-drenched arcade experience where precision meets pulse-pounding rhythm. Navigate your triangle through a mesmerizing maze of shifting shapes, dodge deadly patterns, and chase the perfect run in a game that\u2019s easy to pick up\u2014but hard to put down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca0 <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Tight, responsive controls</strong> \u2013 perfect for quick reflexes and precise movements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf08 <strong>Minimalist visuals</strong> \u2013 clean, vibrant, and hypnotic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Electro-infused soundtrack</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Instant restarts</strong> \u2013 fail fast, try again faster</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're a speedrunner or just vibing with the music, <i>Trianguluv</i> offers a pure, stylish adrenaline rush.</p>",
